    <item>
      <title>How To Deploy NuxtJs Application on IIS</title>
      <link>https://nazmulpro.com/posts/how-to-deploy-nuxtjs-application-on-iis/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Apr 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://nazmulpro.com/posts/how-to-deploy-nuxtjs-application-on-iis/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;please-first-watch-this-video&#34;&gt;Please first watch this video&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;hahahugoshortcode20s0hbhb&#34;&gt;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;
      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/68hUMOQM9DA?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 1:&lt;/strong&gt; Install nodejs LTS version &lt;a href=&#34;https://nodejs.org/en/&#34;&gt;https://nodejs.org/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 2:&lt;/strong&gt; install iisnode (x86 or x64 ) download link : &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/Azure/iisnode&#34;&gt;https://github.com/Azure/iisnode&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 3:&lt;/strong&gt; Install url-rewrite download link : &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.iis.net/downloads/microsoft/url-rewrite&#34;&gt;https://www.iis.net/downloads/microsoft/url-rewrite&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 4:&lt;/strong&gt; Create Simple Nuxt Application &lt;a href=&#34;https://nuxtjs.org/guide/installation#using-code-create-nuxt-app-code&#34;&gt;https://nuxtjs.org/guide/installation#using-code-create-nuxt-app-code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step 5:&lt;/strong&gt; deploy on IIS &lt;a href=&#34;https://nuxtjs.org/faq/deployment-azure-portal&#34;&gt;https://nuxtjs.org/faq/deployment-azure-portal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;web config&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34;&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;security&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;requestFiltering&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;hiddenSegments&amp;gt;
      &amp;lt;add segment=&amp;#34;node\_modules&amp;#34; /&amp;gt;
    &amp;lt;/hiddenSegments&amp;gt;
  &amp;lt;/requestFiltering&amp;gt;
&amp;lt;/security&amp;gt;

&amp;lt;iisnode node\_env=&amp;#34;production&amp;#34; /&amp;gt; 
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</description>
